  {
   "id": 24,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    0,
    1450
   ],
   "size": [
    760,
    460
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 7,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "LTX Refine 4K",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## How to use\n\n1. **Your render**: pick the MiniMax H3 render.\n2. Queue.\n\nLTX works in **8n+1** frames: the last frame is repeated 9 times (192 → 201), and the extra frames are dropped at the end. For another length, set **Last frame ×N** and the **Empty latent** length to the next 8n+1, and **Back to N frames** to your count.\n\nLTX-2.5 22B distilled (int8 on 24 GB) + **Refine Details** at 1.0, 3808×2176, 8 steps, the card's own prompt. **It renders the clip again**: small things can change (a blink).\n\nNeeds Lightricks' LTXVideo node pack. **Their model repos ask you to press Agree and Access on Hugging Face first.**\n\nEvery model link and folder: `LINKS.md`."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## How to use\n\n1. **Your render**: pick the MiniMax H3 render.\n2. Queue.\n\nLTX works in **8n+1** frames: the last frame is repeated 9 times (192 → 201), and the extra frames are dropped at the end. For another length, set **Last frame ×N** and the **Empty latent** length to the next 8n+1, and **Back to N frames** to your count.\n\nLTX-2.5 22B distilled (int8 on 24 GB) + **Refine Details** at 1.0, 3808×2176, 8 steps, the card's own prompt. **It renders the clip again**: small things can change (a blink).\n\nNeeds Lightricks' LTXVideo node pack. **Their model repos ask you to press Agree and Access on Hugging Face first.**\n\nEvery model link and folder: `LINKS.md`."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
